 * MSG_GEN_FIELD_APP_NO_LONGER_EXITING,
 * MSG_GEN_FIELD_ABOUT_TO_DETACH_COMPLETE, MSG_VIS_CLOSE,
 * MSG_OL_FIELD_NAVIGATE_TO_NEXT_APP.
 *
 * The class record of OLFieldClass is here, as in the asm.
 */
